Xal Nara:Nara stares up toward the scale and shakes her head. "Nothing."

"Whatever it is, if it isn't attacking you it's harmless."

Asha Morrow:Asha takes out a multitool, one of many various random items she always has on her, and undoes the panel to pop it out of the wall. She examines the insides of the panel for a minute or so before she makes an attempt to fix what seems to be the issue.

